{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-hostile-species","chapterId":"handbook-monster-4014033","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-hostile-species-handbook-monster-4014033-handbook-monster-4014033-0","text":"「死亡」遗留在生死交界地的残躯，为抗争命运再度苏醒。\n半神不忍目睹故友迈向比「死亡」更残酷的末路，因而伸出长臂挽留。即便仅余槁骨腐肉，其威能与决心仍不可小觑。","speaker":""}]}
